  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Habitat in the region is being impacted by both destructive foraging of a growing snow goose population and by climate change.  We continue our long-term monitoring of the plant community to document the extent of these changes. Graminoid primary production is monitored along with the impact of goose grazing in wet sedge meadows and an intertidal salt-marsh."
  ],
